<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>1</b></sup> O LORD God of my salvation, I have cried day <i>and</i> night before thee:<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>2</b></sup> Let my prayer come before thee: incline thine ear unto my cry;<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>3</b></sup> For my soul is full of troubles: and my life draweth nigh unto the grave.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>4</b></sup> I am counted with them that go down into the pit: I am as a man <i>that hath</i> no strength:<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>5</b></sup> Free among the dead, like the slain that lie in the grave, whom thou rememberest no more: and they are cut off from thy hand.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>6</b></sup> Thou hast laid me in the lowest pit, in darkness, in the deeps.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>7</b></sup> Thy wrath lieth hard upon me, and thou hast afflicted <i>me</i> with all thy waves. Selah.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>8</b></sup> Thou hast put away mine acquaintance far from me; thou hast made me an abomination unto them: <i>I am</i> shut up, and I cannot come forth.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>9</b></sup> Mine eye mourneth by reason of affliction: LORD, I have called daily upon thee, I have stretched out my hands unto thee.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>10</b></sup> Wilt thou shew wonders to the dead? shall the dead arise <i>and</i> praise thee? Selah.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>11</b></sup> Shall thy lovingkindness be declared in the grave? <i>or</i> thy faithfulness in destruction?<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>12</b></sup> Shall thy wonders be known in the dark? and thy righteousness in the land of forgetfulness?<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>13</b></sup> But unto thee have I cried, O LORD; and in the morning shall my prayer prevent thee.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>14</b></sup> LORD, why castest thou off my soul? <i>why</i> hidest thou thy face from me?<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>15</b></sup> I <i>am</i> afflicted and ready to die from <i>my</i> youth up: <i>while</i> I suffer thy terrors I am distracted.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>16</b></sup> Thy fierce wrath goeth over me; thy terrors have cut me off.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>17</b></sup> They came round about me daily like water; they compassed me about together.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">A Song <i>or</i> Psalm for the sons of Korah, to the chief Musician upon Mahalath Leannoth, Maschil of Heman the Ezrahite.</title><sup><b>18</b></sup> Lover and friend hast thou put far from me, <i>and</i> mine acquaintance into darkness. <br />
